KfMqrrdVMzVwRqekNVWIw&oe=6AFDE36B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled (15).png", "id": "646952687853124", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393453_646952694519790_7054400811726926357_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WyqQae0Ne2AQ7kNvwHgtvOa&_nc_oc=AdqfMC-k_G-WXJa7V2M0mEud7i6ElDPeBtx5TUS8z802UIaxsp9sBGN-Wf0g9lWN-oU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5MncGSKMh3yktFkJtHu1jfLBEzwChZxuFKhvrRvEWIw&oe=6AFDB8AC"}, "display_name": "MetaBlogger", "keywords": ["videoplatform", "blog", "blogger", "interactive"], "long_description": "Every day, millions of people watch online videos, but the experience is completely one-sided. You sit back, watch, and if you have a question, you can only hope for an answer buried in a sea of comments. The creators you follow dictate the pace, the topics, and the flow\u2014there\u2019s no way to engage in real-time.\n\nOn top of that, traditional content consumption is limited to flat, 2D screens. No matter how immersive the storytelling, you\u2019re still just an observer, not a participant.\n\nMetaBlogger VR revolutionizes content consumption by making it interactive, responsive, and fully immersive. Instead of passively watching a video, you step inside a VR-powered world where AI-driven metabloggers replace traditional human creators. These AI hosts are not just digital avatars\u2014they respond instantly to your questions, adapt to your interests, and engage with you in a way that no pre-recorded video ever could.", "short_description": "MetaBlogger lets you engage with AI-powered metabloggers in real time. Interrupt, ask questions, and get instant responses as you explore a new era of interactive media. \nKey Features:\n- AI-driven metabloggers instead of human creators\n - Real-time interaction\u2014ask questions anytime"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alindor", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9307986509279061"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391817_9160127644094013_8352989486844017117_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PCE7EIP3u_MQ7kNvwEbYKNI&_nc_oc=AdonwTBfTaJBG3yefWifjA2aH0w26zHzZEV-hGPXZ3evi_KZ6Pz_JccoB-x0m0cPNXI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQexgRfUef7vFdxKeYTmWNaMBZbK_YHlLA_0EpA66E2jw&oe=6AFDD8F7"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "MetaBlogger", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Media", "id": "434961926215971"}, {"topic_name": "Learning", "id": "1043107547362485"}, {"topic_name": "Community", "id": "1228796255027646"}], "release_date": 1742238780, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "9107482125996168", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "9107482075996173",